{
  "_comment": "Operator account transfer: chain facts -> the ordered calls that move everything an old account holds to a new one, each tagged with the account it runs as. Maintained by hand (never emitted from the planner). Amounts are decimal strings. A step is [as, actor, \"Pallet.call\", args]. Each fact about the old account is a pair: `before` is the snapshot taken when the transfer began (what the new account must end up with), `now` is the live state (what is still to be taken away). The two differ only after an interrupted run.",
